{"id":"vd-a2-the-hidden-portrait","level":"a2","n":40,"title":{"en":"Sorry, What Do You Mean?","vi":"Xin lỗi, ý bác là sao ạ?"},"summary":"Bà Kovac cho Noor xem ảnh X-quang bức tranh cổ và giải thích bằng những từ khó; Noor phải hỏi lại cho rõ.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-the-hidden-portrait","level":"a2","title":{"en":"The Hidden Portrait","vi":"Bức chân dung ẩn giấu"}},"scene":{"background":"office","props":[{"id":"laptop","x":800}]},"cast":{"noor":{"name":{"en":"Noor","vi":"Noor"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1F1A1C","skin":"#C98E68","skinShade":"#B07650","scarf":"#8C7BC2","top":"#8C7BC2","topShade":"#7666AD"}},"kovac":{"name":{"en":"Dr. Kovac","vi":"Bà Kovac"},"look":"woman","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"bob","hairColor":"#C9C6CF","glasses":true,"outfit":"coat"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Hello, Noor. Thank you for coming. Look at this image.","vi":"Chào Noor. Cảm ơn cháu đã đến. Cháu nhìn hình này xem.","ipa":["həˈloʊ","","θæŋk","ju","fɔɹ","ˈkʌmɪŋ","lʊk","æt","ðɪs","ˈɪmədʒ"],"start":0.554,"end":5.684,"expression":"happy","gesture":"point","prop":"laptop","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.212],[2,2.657],[3,2.928],[4,3.051],[5,3.187],[6,4.586],[7,4.871],[8,4.966],[9,5.17]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"Is that the painting of the valley?","vi":"Đó là bức tranh thung lũng phải không ạ?","ipa":["ɪz","ðæt","ðə","ˈpeɪntɪŋ","ʌv","ðə","ˈvæli"],"start":6.474,"end":8.344,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,6.474],[1,6.592],[2,6.864],[3,7],[4,7.543],[5,7.693],[6,7.801]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Yes. It's an x-ray. It shows the layers under the paint.","vi":"Đúng. Đây là ảnh X-quang. Nó cho thấy các lớp nằm dưới lớp sơn.","ipa":["jɛs","ɪts","æn","ˈɛksˌɹeɪ","ɪt","ʃoʊz","ðə","ˈleɪɚz","ˈʌndɚ","ðə","peɪnt"],"start":9.134,"end":14.414,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,9.134],[1,10.632],[2,10.836],[3,10.972],[4,12.494],[5,12.657],[6,13.092],[7,13.214],[8,13.662],[9,13.866],[10,13.961]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"Sorry, what does \"layers\" mean?","vi":"Cháu xin lỗi, \"layers\" nghĩa là gì ạ?","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","wʌt","dʌz","ˈleɪɚz","min"],"start":15.204,"end":16.954,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,15.204],[1,15.645],[2,15.848],[3,16.052],[4,16.555]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Layers are like floors in a building. One on top of another.","vi":"Các lớp giống như các tầng của toà nhà vậy. Lớp này chồng lên lớp kia.","ipa":["ˈleɪɚz","ɑɹ","laɪk","flɔɹz","ɪn","ə","ˈbɪldɪŋ","wʌn","ɑn","tɑp","ʌv","əˈnʌðɚ"],"start":17.744,"end":21.904,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,17.744],[1,18.134],[2,18.256],[3,18.501],[4,18.949],[5,19.044],[6,19.126],[7,20.57],[8,20.869],[9,21.032],[10,21.345],[11,21.44]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"So you mean there's another painting under the landscape?","vi":"Vậy ý bác là có một bức tranh khác bên dưới bức phong cảnh ạ?","ipa":["soʊ","ju","min","ðɛɹz","əˈnʌðɚ","ˈpeɪntɪŋ","ˈʌndɚ","ðə","ˈlændˌskeɪp"],"start":22.694,"end":25.514,"expression":"surprised","timing":[[0,22.694],[1,22.797],[2,22.96],[3,23.177],[4,23.408],[5,23.829],[6,24.346],[7,24.59],[8,24.726]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Exactly. A portrait of a young woman.","vi":"Chính xác. Một bức chân dung thiếu nữ.","ipa":["ɪɡˈzæktli","ə","ˈpɔɹtɹət","ʌv","ə","jʌŋ","ˈwʊmən"],"start":26.304,"end":29.594,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,26.304],[1,28.04],[2,28.176],[3,28.638],[4,28.746],[5,28.787],[6,29.167]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"The painter reused the canvas in the eighteenth century.","vi":"Người hoạ sĩ đã dùng lại tấm toan vào thế kỷ mười tám.","ipa":["ðə","ˈpeɪntɚ","ɹiˈuzd","ðə","ˈkænvəs","ɪn","ðə","eɪˈtinθ","ˈsɛntʃɚi"],"start":30.134,"end":33.064,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,30.134],[1,30.198],[2,30.633],[3,31.081],[4,31.176],[5,31.747],[6,31.855],[7,31.951],[8,32.508]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"Sorry, could you say that again, please?","vi":"Cháu xin lỗi, bác nói lại được không ạ?","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","kʊd","ju","seɪ","ðæt","əˈɡɛn","pliz"],"start":33.854,"end":35.814,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,33.854],[1,34.137],[2,34.341],[3,34.449],[4,34.708],[5,34.911],[6,35.319]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Of course. He painted on the same canvas two times.","vi":"Tất nhiên. Ông ấy vẽ lên cùng một tấm toan hai lần.","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","hi","ˈpeɪntɪd","ɑn","ðə","seɪm","ˈkænvəs","tu","taɪmz"],"start":36.604,"end":40.794,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,36.604],[1,36.719],[2,38.285],[3,38.476],[4,38.883],[5,38.992],[6,39.073],[7,39.427],[8,39.957],[9,40.174]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"Why? What do you mean?","vi":"Tại sao ạ? Ý bác là sao ạ?","ipa":["waɪ","wʌt","du","ju","min"],"start":41.584,"end":43.094,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,41.584],[1,42.276],[2,42.425],[3,42.507],[4,42.615]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Paint and canvas were very expensive then.","vi":"Hồi đó sơn và toan đắt lắm.","ipa":["peɪnt","ənd","ˈkænvəs","wɝ","ˈvɛɹi","ɪkˈspɛnsɪv","ðɛn"],"start":43.884,"end":46.234,"gesture":"explain","thoughtBubble":"money:300","timing":[[0,43.884],[1,44.192],[2,44.328],[3,44.872],[4,44.994],[5,45.32],[6,45.918]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"So you mean he painted over his first picture to save money?","vi":"Vậy ý bác là ông ấy vẽ đè lên bức đầu tiên để tiết kiệm tiền ạ?","ipa":["soʊ","ju","min","hi","ˈpeɪntɪd","ˈoʊvɚ","hɪz","fɝst","ˈpɪktʃɚ","tu","seɪv","ˈmʌni"],"start":47.024,"end":50.084,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,47.024],[1,47.117],[2,47.253],[3,47.429],[4,47.606],[5,48.054],[6,48.285],[7,48.503],[8,48.829],[9,49.209],[10,49.331],[11,49.657]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Maybe. Or maybe he didn't like it.","vi":"Có thể. Hoặc có thể ông ấy không thích nó.","ipa":["ˈmeɪbi","ɔɹ","ˈmeɪbi","hi","ˈdɪdənt","laɪk","ɪt"],"start":50.874,"end":53.784,"gesture":"shrug","timing":[[0,50.874],[1,52.405],[2,52.609],[3,52.962],[4,53.098],[5,53.343],[6,53.587]]},{"speaker":"noor","en":"And now, after three hundred years, we can see her again.","vi":"Và giờ, sau ba trăm năm, mình lại được nhìn thấy cô ấy.","ipa":["ənd","naʊ","ˈæftɚ","θɹi","ˈhʌndɹəd","jɪɹz","wi","kæn","si","hɝ","əˈɡɛn"],"start":54.574,"end":57.854,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,54.574],[1,54.648],[2,55.069],[3,55.449],[4,55.735],[5,56.115],[6,56.468],[7,56.645],[8,56.822],[9,57.121],[10,57.311]]},{"speaker":"kovac","en":"Thanks to you, Noor. You really looked.","vi":"Nhờ có cháu đấy, Noor. Cháu đã nhìn thật kỹ.","ipa":["θæŋks","tu","ju","","ju","ˈɹɪli","lʊkt"],"start":58.644,"end":61.984,"expression":"happy","react":{"noor":"shy"},"timing":[[0,58.644],[1,58.861],[2,58.97],[3,59.486],[4,60.903],[5,61.161],[6,61.487]]}],"words":[{"id":"portrait","en":"portrait","ipa":"ˈpɔɹtɹət","vi":"chân dung; bức chân dung; khổ dọc","level":1},{"id":"century","en":"century","ipa":"ˈsɛntʃɚi","vi":"thế kỷ","level":1},{"id":"painter","en":"painter","ipa":"ˈpeɪntɚ","vi":"họa sĩ; thợ sơn","level":1},{"id":"image","en":"image","ipa":"ˈɪmədʒ","vi":"hình ảnh; hình tượng","level":1},{"id":"layer","en":"layer","ipa":"ˈleɪɚ","vi":"lớp; tầng; xếp thành lớp","level":2},{"id":"expensive","en":"expensive","ipa":"ɪkˈspɛnsɪv","vi":"đắt; đắt tiền","level":0}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi lại khi chưa hiểu","pattern":"Sorry, what do you mean? · Could you say that again, please? · So you mean…? · What does … mean?","explain":"Khi chưa hiểu, đừng im lặng: hỏi \"Sorry, what do you mean?\" hoặc \"Could you say that again, please?\". Kiểm tra lại mình hiểu đúng chưa bằng \"So you mean…?\". Hỏi nghĩa một từ: \"What does 'layer' mean?\"","keys":["what do you mean","could you say that again","so you mean","what does"],"lines":[3,5,8,10,12]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-a2-the-hidden-portrait.mp3","v":"e114287428","duration":63.072,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}